{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方拘捕7名非華裔男子，涉嫌非法集結和危險駕駛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">有網上片段拍攝到，多名男子本月5日，在葵涌石蔭路同石宜路交界，追逐一輛私家車，警方經初步調查後，上周五在各區拘捕7名涉案男子，介乎25歲至47歲，所有人獲准保釋候查，須於10月上旬向警署報到。案件交由新界南反三合會行動組跟進。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ARREST-1000_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026LlGH4QycFA1789357177.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ARREST-1000_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:10.170620+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}